{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fantastical world where your bond is your greatest weapon! Duo Quest blends strategic deck building with deep conversational social gameplay to create the perfect co-op game for you to play with a friend or partner.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duo Quest puts you in the shoes of two adventurers set on a quest to defeat the fearsome Demon King who has laid waste to the lands with his evil invention - The Bondbreaker. As the Kingdom\u2019s last hope, you must learn to wield the Duo Energy - a weapon whose strength is tied to its user's bond.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With many monsters to fight, and hundreds of questions to test your relationship with, Duo Quest was made <strong>solely for co-op</strong>, where gamers and non-gamers can play together through an immersive and quirky 8-bit fantasy world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Designed for Co-Op</strong>: </i>Team up with your friend or partner - Duo Quest\u2019s easy to pick up gameplay is the perfect excuse to get your non-gamer friends to play games with you.\u00a0<i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e3608313cd9aae0311af48d1e9613580.poster.avif?t=1766929959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e3608313cd9aae0311af48d1e9613580.webm?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e3608313cd9aae0311af48d1e9613580.mp4?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Quirky and Thought-Provoking Questions:</strong> </i>Learn more about your partner and test your relationship! Discover 1000+ fun questions where you and your partner must match answers to defeat your enemies. With 20+ question themes to discover, every choice shapes your strategy - pick wisely to unlock powerful combo cards and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e732d83d3b9beb53fd19727daf953e78.poster.avif?t=1766929959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e732d83d3b9beb53fd19727daf953e78.webm?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/e732d83d3b9beb53fd19727daf953e78.mp4?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> </i>Explore Duo Quests ever-changing levels, where no run is the same! Take a gamble with randomised routes to battle your way to epic boss battles. Replay levels to discover secrets and unlock every powerful card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/7453855cf3754df676b618230477011a.poster.avif?t=1766929959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/7453855cf3754df676b618230477011a.webm?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/7453855cf3754df676b618230477011a.mp4?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Roguelite Deck Building:</strong> </i>Unlock hundreds of cards with every new run to add to your custom deck and forge your own strategy against your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/12e48498c49761155263e7625874c5a1.poster.avif?t=1766929959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/12e48498c49761155263e7625874c5a1.webm?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/12e48498c49761155263e7625874c5a1.mp4?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classes:</strong> </i>Unlock 5 exciting classes, each with unique card sets and forge your own path to victory!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mysterious Artifacts</strong>: </i>Discover powerful items known as Artifacts through your runs, and enhance your playstyle by turning the odds in your favour.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/34310f7ae5a45437641bf7f2e3678063.poster.avif?t=1766929959\" width=260 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572800/extras/34310f7ae5a45437641bf7f2e3678063.webm?t=1766929959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572800?t=1766929959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamsta